Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.73,0:00:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destiny. Fate. Dreams.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.75,0:00:18.75,Credits-480p,,68,0,23,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,600)\fs78.75}Graphics{\r}\NDatenshi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.99,0:00:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These unstoppable ideals are\Nheld deep in the heart of man.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.75,0:00:21.75,Credits-480p,,68,0,23,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,600)\fs78.75}Karaoke{\r}\NKaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.61,0:00:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.75,0:00:24.75,Credits-480p,,68,0,23,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,600)\fs78.75}Subtitle Editing{\r}\NZenef
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.75,0:00:27.75,Credits-480p,,68,0,23,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,600)\fs78.75}Translation{\r}\NDemonRin\NFUNimation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.05,0:00:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.75,0:00:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.01,0:00:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.69,0:00:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, but so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.77,0:00:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.81,0:00:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.79,0:00:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.65,0:01:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.71,0:01:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.99,0:01:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.27,0:01:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want,\Ntogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.67,0:01:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.91,0:01:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.15,0:01:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.73,0:01:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.89,0:01:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in one another.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.28,0:01:54.11,Title-480p,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(700,750)\3c&H100000&\c&H100000&\1a&HFF&\t(655,700,\1a&H00&)\t(3080,3125,\1a&HFF&)}I Love My Country
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.28,0:01:54.11,Title-480p,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\fad(700,750)\4a&HFF&}I Love My Country
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.83,0:01:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True, our country hasn't seen so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.15,0:01:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as a drop of rain in three years,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.41,0:02:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I still put my trust in\Nthe king as I always have.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.23,0:02:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most of the country still\Nhas faith in him, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.85,0:02:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So many times, I tried to\Nstop them so many times,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.45,0:02:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they won't listen to anything I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.07,0:02:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rebellion isn't stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.71,0:02:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.89,0:02:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,supplies, and men have reached the limit,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.01,0:02:28.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However their intention is to settle\Neverything once and for all with the next
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.35,0:02:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attack their backs are against the wall
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.27,0:02:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're stuck in a corner\Nprepared for death.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.17,0:02:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please Vivi you have to stop these fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.67,0:02:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from tearing our country apart.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.78,0:02:56.80,Captions_v2-480p,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\pos(720,824)\3c&H1E1716&\c&H1E1716&\bord4.5\fsp8}Katorea
Dialogue: 2,0:02:50.78,0:02:56.80,Captions_v2-480p,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\pos(720,824)\bord0\4a&HFF&\fsp8}Katorea
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.05,0:03:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Alabasta?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.27,0:03:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.15,0:03:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toto, old friend, please don't be worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.35,0:03:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.05,0:03:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.59,0:03:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.87,0:03:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.93,0:04:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long, my princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.57,0:04:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't see you for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.33,0:04:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as Yuba's up and\Nrunning, stop by, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.05,0:04:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course I will, Toto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.59,0:04:11.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be the best town ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.51,0:04:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it's up and running, I'll\Npersonally give you the grand tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.35,0:04:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya, Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.65,0:04:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you grow up to become\Na great princess someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.37,0:04:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.28,0:04:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.17,0:04:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koza! I've notified all of our\Ncontacts in the other towns.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.61,0:04:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.52,0:04:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time to strike has finally arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.63,0:04:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.67,0:04:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We aren't nearly as well-armed\Nas I would like us to be, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.19,0:04:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but there's no other choice now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.53,0:05:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a duty to protect our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.67,0:05:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one else can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.15,0:05:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.65,0:05:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.69,0:05:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not beat yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.95,0:05:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.23,0:05:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid kids, Lock here.\NOh, crap. Another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.81,0:05:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it. She's getting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.79,0:05:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Lock there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.25,0:05:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's in the ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.29,0:05:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.03,0:05:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.01,0:05:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.45,0:05:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, boy, what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey kid, where's Princess Vivi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.97,0:06:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi got kidnapped by three men. Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.51,0:06:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad guys went in the old ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.89,0:06:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koza followed him in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.41,0:06:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's trying to save the vice leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.39,0:06:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.73,0:06:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh princess, where did you go little\Ngirl, let's play a game, come out,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.45,0:06:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come out, wherever you are, come out,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.93,0:06:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come out, I don't see her\Nanywhere, little Vivi,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.53,0:06:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can stop hiding,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.01,0:06:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we aren't going to hurt you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.57,0:06:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Found you, little princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.93,0:06:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.45,0:06:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go to run off again on me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.69,0:06:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.89,0:06:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.51,0:06:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.83,0:07:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm fine. Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.53,0:07:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay down, punk, unless\Nyou want another beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.63,0:07:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never surrender the\Nprincess. You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.61,0:07:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid, shut your damn mouth\Nand hand over my meal ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.23,0:07:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing games\Nwith you little brats.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.35,0:07:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a sword. Let's run. Koza!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.09,0:07:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.53,0:07:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.59,0:07:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.50,0:07:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.59,0:07:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protect her to the death, Sansan Clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.05,0:07:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.17,0:07:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.45,0:07:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.79,0:08:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, that damn little kid\Nmanaged to knock out our boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.21,0:08:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.99,0:08:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to make that little brat pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.91,0:08:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.93,0:08:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dead, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.69,0:08:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that, bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.87,0:08:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Papa! You get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.37,0:08:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Vini, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.23,0:08:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You punks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.33,0:08:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You desert garbage!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.71,0:08:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dare to kid them my daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.33,0:08:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dirty swine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.49,0:08:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We took care of the other, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.29,0:08:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chaka! Pell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.57,0:08:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends, why are you two here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.35,0:08:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.26,0:08:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were going to ask\Nyou the same question.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.51,0:08:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would drive a king to\Ntravel so far from home?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.15,0:09:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These areas are a haven for many bandits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.47,0:09:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a place for royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.23,0:09:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Igaram! Kousa's hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.87,0:09:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, he needs immediate medical attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.61,0:09:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The others are also in\Ndire need. Pel! Chaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.21,0:09:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arrange help at once! Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.61,0:09:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You children acted very brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.25,0:09:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Vivi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.77,0:09:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you so distant, child?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.89,0:09:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.47,0:09:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was scared, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.87,0:09:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were so much bigger and stronger\Nthan us and armed to the teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.73,0:09:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.81,0:09:46.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just, Leader, you told\Nthem to protect me to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.37,0:09:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protect her to the death, Sand Sand Clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.27,0:09:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give your life to save mine. Leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.17,0:10:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.69,0:10:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her greatest fear is losing her friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.71,0:10:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.89,0:10:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi may be a little girl,\Nbut she's also a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.25,0:10:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koza, the full measure of gratitude\NI owe you cannot be expressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.79,0:10:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I will simply say, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.99,0:10:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Vivi is one of my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.01,0:10:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would do that for all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.35,0:10:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.35,0:10:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'm certain the next generation of\NAlabasta's people will be in good hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.91,0:10:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you love this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.91,0:10:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.82,0:10:38.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.89,0:10:40.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mine as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.45,0:10:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.57,0:10:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.75,0:10:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is an important matter\Nthat concerns me greatly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.31,0:10:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who are to lead their\Ncountrymen must be able
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.83,0:10:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to make life and death\Ndecisions without hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.89,0:11:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi is far too tender-hearted\Nfor such crushing responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.93,0:11:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir Igaram. Sire?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.95,0:11:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just relax, because as I\Nsee it, Alabasta is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.99,0:11:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.99,0:11:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, it is my greatest\Ndesire to serve you until my death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.41,0:11:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.87,0:11:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly, and that news comes directly from\Nyour dad to mine so you know it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.97,0:11:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh wow, that's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.31,0:11:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your dad asked mine to start a town.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.89,0:11:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said it would be\Nbuilt at the Yuba Oasis.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.90,0:11:35.32,Captions_v2-480p,,0,0,0,,{\pos(753,783)\fscx65\fscy65\fnBD Cartoon Shout\fsp15\b0\bord1.7\c&H3D3D40&\3c&H3D3D40&\blur1}Yuba
