Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.81,0:11:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's considered the\Ncrossroads of Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.17,0:11:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where every merchant and\Ntraveler must pass through.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.37,0:11:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect location.
