Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.61,0:11:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing and that's not even the best part.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.69,0:11:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My dad is going to be the\Nmayor of the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.17,0:12:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to Koza, of course, but my\Ndad wants me to stay here in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.21,0:12:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He says life will be too hard but I just
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.43,0:12:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gotta be where all the\Naction is and live it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.97,0:12:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to help build the\Ncity with my own two hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.73,0:12:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alabasta will need the\Ncity of Yuba to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.25,0:12:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you, Toto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.03,0:12:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes. Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.73,0:12:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll make Alabasta a\Ngreat city for Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.81,0:12:31.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long, my princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.65,0:12:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't see you for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as Yuba's up and\Nrunning, stop by, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.91,0:12:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.99,0:12:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be the best town\Never when it's up and running.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.25,0:12:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll personally give you the grand tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.37,0:12:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.17,0:12:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya, Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.59,0:12:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you grow up to\Nbecome a great princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.07,0:12:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.98,0:12:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koza, stop being so arrogant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.65,0:13:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koza is correct about Yuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This new city will bring great\Nprosperity to the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.29,0:13:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well great job today\Neverybody really we did
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.17,0:13:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some good work now let's\Nall lie down on these
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.79,0:13:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,comfy beds and get some well-deserved rest
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.61,0:13:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,okay we'll need our\Nstrength good night you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.41,0:13:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please this whole trip you've been\Nnothing but lazy why you quit comparing
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.61,0:13:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me to you and all the other superhuman\Nfreaks now you're annoying me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.59,0:13:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think Blue Nose here wins today's award\Nfor laziest talking animal in the desert!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.95,0:13:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're sure walking\Naround in the fur coat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.93,0:13:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, I think that's my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.49,0:13:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, I thought you might have trouble\Nsleeping here all alone tonight, Veer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.67,0:13:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the award for biggest\Nperv goes to Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.93,0:13:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, slingshot boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.45,0:13:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna shove that pillow so far\Ndown your throat you'll choke on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.85,0:13:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys don't think to\Nunderstand the concept!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.93,0:14:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.85,0:14:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, old guy, there's still no water.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.91,0:14:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My throat's drying up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.77,0:14:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you stand to live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.73,0:14:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.23,0:14:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The water will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.95,0:14:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Yuba Oasis still has life in it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.09,0:14:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dream of Yuba can't be\Nbeaten by a bunch of lousy sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.01,0:14:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The king left this land in my\Nhands and I will keep it alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.49,0:14:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll dig out the sand as\Nmany times as it takes. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.51,0:14:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then, let's dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.11,0:14:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, would you quit filling the hole\Nup I spent all this time on? Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.59,0:14:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never get done with\Nyou filling my holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.49,0:14:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm digging just like you, old guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.25,0:14:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm digging holes and\Nyou're filling them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.73,0:14:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sand from the hole you're digging\Nis going into the hole I'm digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.15,0:14:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, you're not helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.89,0:15:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, a mystery hole, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.77,0:15:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.25,0:15:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.89,0:15:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe he figured it out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.07,0:15:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sand stopped coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.57,0:15:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was able to dig that\Nin such a short time,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.43,0:15:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even as tired as he must\Nbe from the journey?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.21,0:15:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sleep well tonight, you've earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.45,0:15:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Food and water.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.05,0:15:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pleasant dreams.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.95,0:15:54.66,Captions_v2-480p,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\pos(720,661.5)\fad(750,0)\bord3\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(705,750,\1a&H00&)}Casino\NRain Dinners
Dialogue: 2,0:15:48.95,0:15:54.66,Captions_v2-480p,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\pos(720,661.5)\fad(750,0)\bord0\4a&HFF&}Casino\NRain Dinners
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.03,0:15:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.53,0:15:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.39,0:15:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long are we going to have\Nto wait around like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.23,0:15:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you at least going to\Noffer some refreshments?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.03,0:16:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could be practicing my\Ndance instead of sitting here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.09,0:16:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hoo-hoo-hoo! Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.49,0:16:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tu, just sit still over\Nthere and wait quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.67,0:16:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.58,0:16:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you stupid man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.81,0:16:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You calm down, too, Miss Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.51,0:16:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it isn't too surprising\Nthat you don't all get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.53,0:16:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.53,0:16:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It isn't necessary that you do, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.01,0:16:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss all Sunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.73,0:16:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you all for coming so far to attend\Nthis gathering of ours in Rain Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.09,0:16:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The city where gambling is the only king,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.47,0:16:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and every man and woman\Ndreams of going home rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.89,0:16:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Rain Dinners, the\Nlargest casino in the whole city.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.63,0:16:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss All Sunday, could we skip the\Nformalities and get to the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.63,0:16:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I was just getting to that, Mr. Wong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.61,0:16:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get this started already!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.03,0:16:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.94,0:16:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start, start, start!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.86,0:16:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.77,0:16:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, but there's something\Nthat needs to be taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.69,0:16:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to meet our boss,\Nwhose face you've never seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.55,0:17:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been acting as his face\Nand his voice for some time now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.13,0:17:03.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,delivering orders as he saw fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.45,0:17:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no longer any need\Nfor such secrecy, however.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.43,0:17:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, the time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.71,0:17:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For Operation Utopia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.67,0:17:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.67,0:17:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be the greatest and the final\Noperation that Baroque Works carries out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.19,0:17:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems you're familiar with our boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.49,0:17:26.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or his public identity, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.11,0:17:30.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course we are, but why is\None of the seven warlords leading us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.57,0:17:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we didn't expect to have\Nsuch a big shot guy for our leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.69,0:17:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me get this straight, we've been\Nworking for a pirate since the first day!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.29,0:17:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then you are actually our boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.11,0:17:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.87,0:17:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a problem, but\Nit is a bit confusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.93,0:17:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Seven Warlords are pirates\Nsanctioned by the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.71,0:17:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you need a\Ncompany like this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.79,0:17:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not seek money or status.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.05,0:18:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is something more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.51,0:18:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Military strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.91,0:18:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Military strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.09,0:18:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.05,0:18:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you my true objective,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.59,0:18:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my goal, and the final operation that\NBaroque Works will be conducting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.43,0:18:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean something like that\Nreally exists on this island?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.97,0:18:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we're going to steal the\Nwhole country along with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.69,0:18:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This assignment is making\Nme tremble all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.41,0:18:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So these new orders are the\Nfinal pieces of one giant
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.49,0:18:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,plan that Baroque Works\Nhas been working towards?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.37,0:18:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.01,0:18:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every assignment performed as an agent,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.55,0:19:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,every mission finished\Nsince Baroque Works was
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.75,0:19:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,founded has been part\Nof the single operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.37,0:19:07.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And those letters there are the\Nfinal orders that you will receive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.35,0:19:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time has finally come\Nfor Alabasta Kingdom to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.71,0:19:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,disappear once each of you\Nhas Completed the assignment
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.79,0:19:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have before you this\Ndesert kingdom will destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.75,0:19:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itself from the inside\Nout the rebel and royal
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.15,0:19:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,armies will have nowhere\Nto go Nowhere to turn as
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.51,0:19:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a result they will fall\Nneatly into the hands of
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.85,0:19:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baroque Works if all goes\Naccording to plan in a
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.97,0:19:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,single night Alabasta Kingdom\Nwill become our utopia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.45,0:19:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This mission is the final and\Nmost important act that Baroque
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.49,0:19:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Works will carry out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.67,0:19:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Failure is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.25,0:19:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We begin tomorrow at\Nnoon. Yes sir! Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.85,0:19:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.87,0:20:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About this Operation Utopia, may I\Nask you to postpone it for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.05,0:20:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.51,0:20:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The location of this room is a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.79,0:20:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what little hidey-hole did\Nyou crawl out of to get here, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.71,0:20:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.62,0:20:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I will finally complete my mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.63,0:20:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Mr. Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.25,0:20:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't crawl out from\Nanywhere, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.39,0:20:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I merely followed you all from your\Nlittle meeting at Spider's Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.25,0:20:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was easy enough to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.71,0:20:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hitched a ride on the\Nback of Bunchy's car unseen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.11,0:20:31.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss, at last we meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.05,0:20:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have come here to humbly\Nbeg for your forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.49,0:20:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to ask that I may be\Ngiven a second chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.95,0:20:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, Mr. True,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.95,0:20:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew that it was only a matter of time\NBefore someone was sent to eliminate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.43,0:20:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After I failed to complete the\Nassignment that I was given.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.75,0:20:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is why I made the decision\Nto change my course slightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.13,0:20:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And head directly for our\Nheadquarters at the Spider's Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.01,0:20:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you had failed\Nto complete a mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.43,0:20:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.95,0:20:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.89,0:21:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How I was unfortunately unable\Nto prevent the Straw Hat Brats.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.29,0:21:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Princess Vivi from escaping, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.77,0:21:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're telling me that they got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.13,0:21:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.83,0:21:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying that they're still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.91,0:21:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were you talking about\Non the transponder snail?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.87,0:21:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said that they were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.75,0:21:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi and her bratty\Nlittle pirate friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.45,0:21:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did deal with them, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.69,0:21:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A transponder snail?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.13,0:21:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.59,0:21:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never used a transponder snail the\Nentire time I was on Little Garden,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.01,0:21:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not even once. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.57,0:21:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.75,0:21:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've reached the Crab Café.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.37,0:21:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I take your order?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.27,0:21:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good news,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.11,0:21:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,although it does explain why the Unluckies\Nhaven't returned from Little Garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.37,0:21:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume you at least got\Nrid of one or two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.53,0:21:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.79,0:21:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.70,0:21:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The information I was given\Nwasn't entirely accurate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.19,0:22:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There were four pirate\Nescorts with Princess Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.89,0:22:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then on top of that, there was this\Nreally funny-looking man with a long...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.99,0:22:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.27,0:22:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.79,0:22:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you explain to the rest of us\Nwhat's going on with all this insanity?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.41,0:22:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of this makes any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.03,0:22:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.43,0:22:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I met all of these people!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.55,0:22:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I ran into them\Non my way to the cafe!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.93,0:22:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.23,0:22:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was this guy, and\Nthis guy, and this girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.75,0:22:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and this guy, and this thing too,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.07,0:22:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,plus one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.41,0:22:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Miss Wednesday is really a\Nprincess posing as an agent?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.89,0:22:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean these people are\Nall actually the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.41,0:22:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.55,0:22:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These people haven't\Ncovered who I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.89,0:22:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They need to be taken care of, or\Nthey'll interfere with the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.27,0:22:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.18,0:22:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three, you're right about one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.47,0:23:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It does seem like they have\Nadded one person and one animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.61,0:23:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their group is increasing in number\Nas they continue to move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.25,0:23:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Setting the pet aside,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.39,0:23:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think there is something that we\Ncan safely assume at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.47,0:23:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi and her four little friends\Nare very likely in Alabasta already.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.05,0:23:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now to prepare. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.67,0:23:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two, make photos of those\Nfaces you displayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.21,0:23:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, but boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.31,0:23:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise that I will eliminate Vivi\Nand her friends with my own two hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.29,0:23:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shut up, you damn fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.59,0:23:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.71,0:23:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three, listen very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.39,0:23:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea why\NI gave you your ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.23,0:23:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why you're an officer agent, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.55,0:23:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In terms of fighting\Nskills alone, even Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.59,0:23:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four has you beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.73,0:23:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.05,0:23:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promoted you because of your underhanded
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.51,0:23:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tenacity when it comes to\Ncompleting an assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.81,0:23:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have greatly disappointed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.61,0:23:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.53,0:23:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just shriveling up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.77,0:23:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.01,0:24:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need water!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.17,0:24:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some water!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.13,0:24:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can have all the water you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.57,0:24:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.43,0:24:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks to be feeding time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.77,0:24:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I now? Underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.33,0:24:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks almost like a giant aquarium.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.49,0:24:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm at the gate door!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.95,0:24:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing but trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.17,0:24:47.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.83,0:24:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the rest of you listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.71,0:24:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a good look at these five.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.45,0:24:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are determined to stop\Nthe rebellion in Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.59,0:25:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we leave them alone, they\Nare bound to come to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.49,0:25:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.03,0:25:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But boss, even if the girl is\Nthe princess of this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.13,0:25:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think that she can\Nprevent the Rebellion at this point?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.93,0:25:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, she has a connection\Nthat she can take advantage of.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.43,0:25:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi Nefertari\Nand the Rebel leader Koza
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.37,0:25:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were apparently friends\Nwhen they were children.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.87,0:25:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Rebels have 700,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.49,0:25:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if the Rebellion\Ncan't be stopped now,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.07,0:25:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi is certainly capable of\Nbringing real confusion to their ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.85,0:25:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already sent many of the billions\Nto join with Koza's Rebel forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.89,0:25:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact that I haven't heard\Nanything from our men must
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.31,0:25:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mean that Vivi and her friends\Nhave not yet taken any action.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.45,0:25:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.36,0:25:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever the cost,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.28,0:25:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they must be prevented\Nfrom making contact with
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.11,0:25:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Rebel Army before the\Noperation is complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.71,0:25:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we have won.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.95,0:25:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss All Sunday. Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.25,0:25:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given the current circumstances,\Nwe should use transponder snails.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.09,0:25:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Contact the billions who are in Nanohana.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.77,0:25:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell them to kill on sight\Nwithout any hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.57,0:26:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not allow Princess Vivi\Nand the pirates into Katorea!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.77,0:26:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi must not be allowed to\Nmeet with the rebel leader Koza!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.13,0:26:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.69,0:26:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the rest of you get going as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.41,0:26:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want to miss the fun, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.89,0:26:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are very close to realizing our utopia.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.67,0:26:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd hate to be disappointed by any of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.23,0:26:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You understand. Just\Nleave it to us, boss sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.19,0:26:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go enjoy yourselves
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.23,0:26:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.49,0:26:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't have more to\Noffer you princess Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.61,0:26:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, please don't worry about it Well, we\Nshould be off now Toto. Oh Luffy. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.13,0:26:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this with you
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.57,0:26:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Water! Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.99,0:27:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You found some, then? Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.77,0:27:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was last night a bit after you fell\Nasleep while digging that huge hole of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.87,0:27:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally reached a moist\Nlayer under the dry stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.89,0:27:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That water there is the moisture that I\Nwas able to extract from the damp sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.93,0:27:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.84,0:27:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds pretty\Ncomplicated, but thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.07,0:27:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That right there is genuine Yuba water.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.63,0:27:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not much, but it's all\NI was able to get. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.27,0:27:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll drink it with care.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.51,0:27:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.43,0:27:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, what are you doing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.69,0:27:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.60,0:27:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, is everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.89,0:27:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.23,0:27:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.81,0:27:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.35,0:27:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.73,0:27:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit what, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.77,0:27:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.25,0:28:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to put up with every\Nweird little mood you have right now, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.23,0:28:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.61,0:28:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, shouldn't we get going?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.35,0:28:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, we should and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.79,0:28:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't get back to\Nthat Katorea place the way
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.15,0:28:09.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we came and stop the rebellion\Nthat's about to begin,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.61,0:28:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then a million Alabasta\Ncitizens are gonna start
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.65,0:28:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fighting and things will\Nget real ugly real quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.25,0:28:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're doing this for Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.11,0:28:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.85,0:28:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.05,0:28:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi? Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.69,0:28:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, all I want to do is kick\NCrocodile's ass, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.27,0:28:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can keep the people\Nfrom starting a rebellion,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.11,0:28:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that won't stop Crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.03,0:28:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, we won't be able to\Naccomplish anything in Katorea.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.87,0:28:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're pirates. Everyone knows things\Nare better off without us around.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.67,0:28:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta admit,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.79,0:28:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he has a way of getting straight to\Nthe point when he really wants to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.25,0:28:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, but not often, no, that's not\Ntrue. You want it to work out so that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.27,0:29:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nobody dies in this fight isn't that\Nright Vivi none of the citizens none of
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.11,0:29:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us either we're up against one of the\Nseven warlords of the sea and a million
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.59,0:29:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of your own people on top of that and\Nyou still want everyone to end up all?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.83,0:29:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.81,0:29:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never win that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.39,0:29:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.67,0:29:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you at least try showing\NVivi a little sympathy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.17,0:29:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on, Nami. For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.49,0:29:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's wrong with that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.55,0:29:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is so wrong about\Nnot wanting to see people
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.13,0:29:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,die or get hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.09,0:29:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because people die, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.23,0:29:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop talking like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.47,0:29:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't listen to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.21,0:29:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say that again and I will really hurt you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.73,0:29:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the whole point of what we're\Ndoing here, don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.75,0:29:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one here in Alabasta,\Nnot the rebel army,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.29,0:29:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the royal army, or the\Npeople is to blame for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.65,0:29:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of them have done anything wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.29,0:30:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should any of them have\Nto pay for what's happened
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.53,0:30:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when every last bit of\Nit is Crocodile's fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.69,0:30:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're saying it's only\Nall right for you to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.53,0:30:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Luffy, you've gone too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.57,0:30:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.93,0:30:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just being in this country one day and\Ntaking a look around, even I can tell!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.53,0:30:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.11,0:30:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What this country needs\Nmore than anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.23,0:30:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This Oasis has life in it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.55,0:30:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dream of Yuba can't be\Nbeaten by a bunch of lousy sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.11,0:30:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think that\Nputting just your life on
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.25,0:30:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the line is enough to\Nstop this from happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.59,0:30:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what else exactly should I be\Nputting on the line with it then, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.23,0:30:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let him get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.19,0:30:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.69,0:31:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have anything else I can\Nput on the line. Just... just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.85,0:31:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you can at least try putting\Nall of our lives on the line together!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.89,0:31:12.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't we friends, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.29,0:31:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't we friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.05,0:31:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.19,0:31:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.71,0:31:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.01,0:31:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you can cry.
